WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.243
The through-air belt dryer removes surface
moisture before frying.

00:00:04.313 --> 00:00:08.508
Compare masses across the same lot interval to
test the drying result.

00:00:08.718 --> 00:00:15.090
Wire the outlet belt scale to AI06 and the
circulation fan demand to AO06.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:19.520
Fan demand describes the action, while the scale
provides evidence.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.573
Set model mass reduction to 6 per cent.

00:00:22.643 --> 00:00:27.587
The worked batch enters at 895.18 kilograms.

00:00:27.797 --> 00:00:30.403
Inject the invalid outlet scale fault.

00:00:30.473 --> 00:00:35.624
An inlet reading from one interval cannot be
balanced against an unrelated outlet reading.

00:00:35.834 --> 00:00:39.223
Restore the outlet scale and match both batch
intervals.

00:00:39.293 --> 00:00:45.331
The worked reduction is 53.711 kilograms before
the strips move to frying.
